# Paths excluded from Claude Code context for Wisedo-Technology/wisedo-ai-supervisor

## Derived from .gitignore, .dockerignore, SECURITY.md, deploy/supervisor/README.md and

## deploy/aws/README.md. Nothing here is a product source of truth; everything here is either

## generated, vendored, or a credential/evidence artifact that must never enter a prompt or log

## --- Secrets and local credentials (SECURITY.md, deploy/supervisor/README.md) ---

.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.keystore
**/secrets/
**/*credential*
**/*.tfvars
!deploy/aws/terraform.tfvars.example

## --- Go build output ---

/build/
/bin/
*.test
*.out
coverage.*

## --- Frontend ---

web/node_modules/
web/dist/
web/.vite/
web/playwright-report/
web/test-results/
node_modules/

## --- Native Future Vision build and inspection artifacts ---

build/vision-cpp/
src/wisedo_fixture_vision_cpp/build/
inspection_results/
*.mp4
*.avi
*.o
*.a
*.so
*.dylib

## --- Terraform state and plan output (deploy/aws) ---

deploy/aws/.terraform/
deploy/aws/*.tfstate
deploy/aws/*.tfstate.*
deploy/aws/*.tfplan
deploy/aws/.terraform.lock.hcl

## --- Python training workload caches (offline, optional) ---

deploy/aws/training/**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
.venv/
.uv/

## --- Generated and vendored artifacts; read the source contract instead ---

go.sum
web/package-lock.json
**/*.generated.go
**/*.gen.ts
vendor/

## --- Evaluation, release and customer evidence bundles (WIS-280 / WIS-281) ---

## Sanitized traces and release bundles may carry customer content; open them deliberately

## never by default

evals/__/traces/
evals/__/runs/
release-evidence/
*.sbom.json

## --- Local tooling noise ---

.DS_Store
.idea/
*.log
tmp/
